name tikz-planets
category Package
revision 55002
shortdesc Illustrate celestial mechanics and the solar system
relocated 1
longdesc This TikZ-package makes it easy to illustrate celestial
longdesc mechanics and the solar system. You can use it to draw sketches
longdesc of the eclipses, the phases of the Moon, etc. The package
longdesc requires the standard packages TikZ, xcolor, xstring, and
longdesc pgfkeys.
runfiles size=4
